), and with anemia due to ongoing intravascular hemolysis. Participants were to commence treatment at the same BCX9930 dose level and regimen last administered to that individual in the prior study. Per last protocol amendment, all participants received BCX9930 400 mg orally BID. Treatment duration was up to 144 weeks."},{"id":"OG001","title":"C5-INH Inadequate Response Group","description":"This group included participants who, prior to enrolling in their previous BCX9930 study, were receiving stable treatment with eculizumab or ravulizumab and had an inadequate response to that therapy (ie, residual anemia and/or ongoing need for transfusion). Depending on the prior study, participants may have continued the C5 inhibitor, with BCX9930 provided as an add-on therapy. Participants were to commence treatment at the same BCX9930 dose level and regimen last administered to that individual in the prior study. Per last protocol amendment, all participants received BCX9930 400 mg orally BID. Treatment duration was up to 144 weeks."}],"denoms":[{"units":"Participants","counts":[{"groupId":"OG000","value":"12"},{"groupId":"OG001","value":"7"}]}],"classes":[{"title":"Baseline-none","denoms":[{"units":"Participants","counts":[{"groupId":"OG000","value":"12"},{"groupId":"OG001","value":"7"}]}],"categories":[{"measurements":[{"groupId":"OG000","value":"11"},{"groupId":"OG001","value":"6"}]}]},{"title":"Baseline-mild","denoms":[{"units":"Participants","counts":[{"groupId":"OG000","value":"12"},{"groupId":"OG001","value":"7"}]}],"categories":[{"measurements":[{"groupId":"OG000","value":"1"},{"groupId":"OG001","value":"1"}]}]},{"title":"Baseline-moderate","denoms":[{"units":"Participants","counts":[{"groupId":"OG000","value":"12"},{"groupId":"OG001","value":"7"}]}],"categories":[{"measurements":[{"groupId":"OG000","value":"0"},{"groupId":"OG001","value":"0"}]}]},{"title":"Baseline-severe","denoms":[{"units":"Participants","counts":[{"groupId":"OG000","value":"12"},{"groupId":"OG001